    "definition_raw": "Source Distant Realms pg. 33\nYour thrown weapons become pure light, overcoming enemy defenses.\n\nPrerequisites: Lantern Style, Point-Blank Shot, Precise Shot, good or lawful alignment, caster level 7th or monk level 7th.\n\nBenefit: When you make a single ranged attack with a thrown weapon, that weapon temporarily transforms into pure holy light, overcoming the target’s damage reduction, if any.",
